Package: mos-board-s905x5m
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: mos build <mos@example.invalid>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: mos-system (= @VERSION@), kmod, alsa-utils
Description: MOS board support for S905X5M BM201
 Kernel modules and resolved config, Seekwave firmware, audio initialization,
 partition configuration, and package-owned boot inputs for the Amlogic S7D.
 Radio services are selected independently by the board radio manifests.
